  <data name="dataGridView1.ToolTip" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>TO ADD A URL OR FILE HYPERLINK TO A MEMORY:
选择 a 记忆 (Row) with your mouse
Drag &amp; Drop a File, or URL onto the Selected Row
or Drag &amp; Drop directly to the 添加 button to create new 记忆

TO USE THE HYPERLINK:
