  <data name="textBox1.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Highlight a memory by a single left click on a row.
You can drag a file or URL directy onto the highlighted row to save a hyperlink.
Right click on a highlighted row to go to the hyperlink or open the file.
Double left click to go to that 记忆 频率/mode.
In Panadapter use ALT + M keys to save new memory.
Spotter can display all your memories. (displayed in blue in Panadapter)</value>
